Description: Link the TBB calls in the Import workbench
 Open CASCADE's Debian build enables HAVE_TBB. ImportOCAF.cpp then
 calls TBB directly, so Import must declare that link dependency.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Bug: https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD/issues/33573
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-27

--- a/src/Mod/Import/App/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/Mod/Import/App/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -91 +91,2 @@
-target_link_libraries(Import ${Import_LIBS})
+find_package(TBB CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS tbb)
+target_link_libraries(Import ${Import_LIBS} TBB::tbb)
